            },
            {
              "name": "value",
              "statistic": "S.value",
              "column": "result.value"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "documentation": "https://documentation.sas.com/doc/en/statug/15.2/statug_means_overview.htm",
      "notes": "PROC MEANS N with CLASS for grouping; the where=(_type_>0) filter drops the grand-total row produced by the class hierarchy. Uses <group> because the M.Count method declares its grouping input_role as name='group'."
